{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1NjYW0tMTk5Mi1UaGUtSGFyc2hhZC1NZWh0YS1TdG9yeS0lMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Scam 1992 The Harshad Mehta Story","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pt0QenYvXHlPJ6rsegEY6bKCLwt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uFaGex9umvFRfp1NlieTXH4BGE4.jpg","description":"The brothers Vanya, Kostya and Danila Popov kept the whole village in fear for many years and terrorized the neighbors. The coronavirus pandemic changed everything: the brothers locked themselves in their house, and the residents breathed a sigh of peace for the first time in many years. At the end of the self-isolation, the villagers unanimously decide not to inform the Popov family about the lifting of quarantine. So begins a big scam involving the entire village of 200 people. Everyone's peace and well-being are at stake, but how long will it be possible to keep a secret and won't it have more serious consequences? Residents are trying to do everything to prevent failure. Meanwhile, the younger Popov falls in love with a nurse who has arrived from the city and jeopardizes the entire village plan.","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1NjYW0tMTk5Mi1UaGUtSGFyc2hhZC1NZWh0YS1TdG9yeS0lMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2002-09-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1NjYW0tMTk5Mi1UaGUtSGFyc2hhZC1NZWh0YS1TdG9yeS0lMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2002-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1NjYW0tMTk5Mi1UaGUtSGFyc2hhZC1NZWh0YS1TdG9yeS0lMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2002-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3